  "description": "Cafe Florence's owner, Yu Ji-An, has someone who is more like an older brother to him than his own brother. He is Choi Jae-Geon, the successor of Hwaseong Construction, who is always anxious about not being able to catch Ji-An. One day, Ji-An, who has lost her place due to some incident, is the first to reach out to Jae-Gun. \"Let's go to Oppa's house.\" That's how their cohabitation began. The two who were always bickering and growling at each other's faces started to have a strange atmosphere between them. \"Let's go to Oppa's room.\" Ji-An's heart flutters at Jae-Gun's one word. \n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
